WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly developed
technology,

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.069 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:06.439
to record the tiny voice that is
inside Donald Trump's head

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you might be surprised
to know that,

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
like everyone's inner voice,
Donald Trump's is filled

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
with paralyzing fear
and self-doubt.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:13.947 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, here it is,

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:17.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Donald, it's the tin
voice in the back of your head

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:25.759 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and it's time once again

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:27.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
for your least favorite thin
about the job,

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
waiting for foreign people
to stop talking

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.098 line:92%
so you can eat your dinner

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:36.369
And you have to pretend
to listen and give a little nod.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, good point.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't understand
a word you said,

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I want to eat
these dumplings.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:41.741 line:92%
I'm going to look at them,

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:47.113
and I'm gonna steal a little
peek at my dumplings and..

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:47.714 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
there they are.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, one, two, three.
That's good.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.951
I'll eat those, and then Melania
will give me hers.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.753 line:92%
That's six, seven, eight.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:54.554 line:92%
So that's eight dumplings,

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.957 size:88% position:44%
and maybe Shinzo's wife
will give me one or two.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.392 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That's 15, 16 dumplings.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.560 line:92%
That's a lot of dumplings.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:05.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
This will be worth it,
but you have to stop talking

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.803 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

